# One file at the repo root guards EVERY image, because the build context is
# always the repo root.

# history & secrets - never in an image
.git
**/.env*

# pipeline & IDE files
.github
.vs
.vscode
.idea

# local build junk - the image builds fresh
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular

# docs
**/*.md
